{"id":"wb-7-1204","name":"青龙宫","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"青龙宫 (武陟县)","text":"青龙宫位于中华人民共和国河南省焦作市武陟县县城西北万花庄村，是祭祀青龙的庙宇，旧称青龙祠、龙王庙。宫内保存戏楼、拜殿、玉皇阁、寝宫等建筑，庙宇活动与当地的祈雨习俗及农历二月初二庙会相联系。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%9D%92%E9%BE%99%E5%AE%AB_(%E6%AD%A6%E9%99%9F%E5%8E%BF)","revisionId":95427232,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95427232","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/775c73a4b86ed7d09e83a0a2.jpg","title":"20230512_Qinglong_Palace_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20230512_Qinglong_Palace_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/50/20230512_Qinglong_Palace_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Qinglong Palace in Wuzhi County, Jiaozuo, Henan","width":320,"height":213}}